/**
 * Translates text generated by the backend (reasons, attack names, actions, checks, audit entries…).
 * English is the backend's source language, so `en` returns the text unchanged; `ar` translates it.
 * Proper names (hostnames, IPs, MITRE IDs, segments, product names) stay as they are.
 * Coverage is tested against every string the engines produce across the 40 scenarios (tr.test.ts).
 */
